<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan starts Glaxo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan starts Glaxo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glaxo Wellcome Plc was rated &quot;buy&quot; at JP Morgan as analyst Mark Becker started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Becker said Glaxo had a strong product pipeline and an &quot;unparalleled ability to exploit strong research and development and marketing capabilities&quot;.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
